SystemRequirement001 status inherited.
SystemRequirement001 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-001: Separate runtime authorities".
SystemRequirement001 specifies "The system SHALL preserve distinct runtime authorities for physical/simulated P1000 target transport, machine/P1000 semantics and calibration, bucking/forestry computation, browser adaptation, browser presentation and optional Lab diagnostics.".
SystemRequirement001 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement001 constrains MVP1.
SystemRequirement002 status inherited.
SystemRequirement002 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-002: No hidden authority migration".
SystemRequirement002 specifies "A frontend, Lab, web adapter or transport gateway SHALL NOT become machine or bucking authority merely because it can send a command or display state.".
SystemRequirement002 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement002 constrains DomainTruthOwned.
SystemRequirement003 status inherited.
SystemRequirement003 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-003: Simulator/gateway interchangeability".
SystemRequirement003 specifies "MachineService SHALL consume one versioned target contract that can be implemented by P1000Simulator or p1000-gateway without simulator-specific MachineService application branches.".
SystemRequirement003 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement003 constrains TargetContract.
SystemRequirement004 status inherited.
SystemRequirement004 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-004: BuckingWeb dual upstream".
SystemRequirement004 specifies "BuckingWeb SHALL maintain independently observable connections to MachineService and BuckingService and SHALL support machine telemetry/commands when BuckingService is unavailable.".
SystemRequirement004 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement004 constrains MaintainDualUpstreams.
SystemRequirement005 status inherited.
SystemRequirement005 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-005: Labs are optional sidecars".
SystemRequirement005 specifies "MachineLab and BuckingLab SHALL be removable without changing authoritative service behavior.".
SystemRequirement005 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement005 constrains MachineLab.
SystemRequirement005 constrains BuckingLab.
SystemRequirement006 status inherited.
SystemRequirement006 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-006: Internal IPC".
SystemRequirement006 specifies "Separately deployable internal constituents SHALL use ordinary IP/TCP contracts at runtime, including when colocated on one host.".
SystemRequirement006 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement006 constrains CommonServiceContract.
SystemRequirement007 status inherited.
SystemRequirement007 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-007: Protobuf authority".
SystemRequirement007 specifies "Internal service wire schemas SHALL be defined in versioned Protobuf authority and generated for supported implementation languages.".
SystemRequirement007 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement007 constrains ContractRegistry.
SystemRequirement008 status inherited.
SystemRequirement008 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-008: TCP message framing".
SystemRequirement008 specifies "Internal TCP protocols SHALL provide explicit message-length framing and SHALL NOT assume one read/write call equals one logical message.".
SystemRequirement008 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement008 constrains FrameServiceMessages.
SystemRequirement009 status inherited.
SystemRequirement009 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-009: Browser transport".
SystemRequirement009 specifies "BuckingWeb/BuckingUI runtime SHALL use versioned JSON messages over WebSocket; REST/JSON SHALL remain available for snapshot/config/export/recovery where specified.".
SystemRequirement009 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement009 constrains OperatorBrowserContract.
SystemRequirement010 status inherited.
SystemRequirement010 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-010: Diagnostic representation".
SystemRequirement010 specifies "Binary internal messages SHALL have a stable human-readable JSON/NDJSON representation usable by Lab/export/debug tooling.".
SystemRequirement010 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement010 constrains FormatLabConsole.
SystemRequirement011 status inherited.
SystemRequirement011 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-011: Contract compatibility".
SystemRequirement011 specifies "Shared contracts SHALL use stable field identities and explicit compatibility/versioning rules. Removed Protobuf field numbers SHALL NOT be repurposed.".
SystemRequirement011 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement011 constrains GovernContractEvolution.
SystemRequirement012 status inherited.
SystemRequirement012 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-012: Distinct identity domains".
SystemRequirement012 specifies "The implementation SHALL keep service session, source event sequence, delivery-stream sequence, command ID, domain revision, gateway delivery sequence and P1000 sequence as distinct concepts.".
SystemRequirement012 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement012 constrains DistinctSequenceDomains.
SystemRequirement013 status inherited.
SystemRequirement013 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-013: Service event ordering".
SystemRequirement013 specifies "Every event-publishing service SHALL expose a monotonically increasing **source event sequence** within one service session. Filtered subscriptions and supersedable delivery MAY legitimately observe sparse source-event sequences and SHALL NOT infer transport loss from source-event gaps alone.".
SystemRequirement013 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement013 constrains ScheduleSubscriberDelivery.
SystemRequirement014 status inherited.
SystemRequirement014 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-014: Command correlation".
SystemRequirement014 specifies "Every command SHALL carry a correlation identity preserved through its command-result lifecycle.".
SystemRequirement014 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement014 constrains StableCommandIdentity.
SystemRequirement015 status inherited.
SystemRequirement015 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-015: Source provenance".
SystemRequirement015 specifies "Normalized machine/operator events SHALL preserve source provenance sufficient to distinguish physical P1000 wire, simulated P1000 wire, semantic command injection and replay.".
SystemRequirement015 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement015 constrains ConsumeTargetRecord.
SystemRequirement016 status inherited.
SystemRequirement016 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-016: Raw traceability".
SystemRequirement016 specifies "Where P1000 semantics are derived from raw traffic, diagnostics SHALL be able to trace the semantic value/event back to raw/source provenance without forcing raw bytes into every high-rate presentation event.".
SystemRequirement016 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement016 constrains DecodeP1000Frames.
SystemRequirement017 status inherited.
SystemRequirement017 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-017: Command/event separation".
SystemRequirement017 specifies "Commands SHALL request actions; events SHALL report accepted facts/state changes; snapshots/queries SHALL read state without implying mutation.".
SystemRequirement017 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement017 constrains MachineContract.
SystemRequirement017 constrains BuckingContract.
SystemRequirement018 status inherited.
SystemRequirement018 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-018: Runtime capability catalog".
SystemRequirement018 specifies "MachineService and BuckingService SHALL publish runtime command/capability availability. A schema-defined command SHALL NOT be assumed usable solely because its message type exists.".
SystemRequirement018 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement018 constrains PublishAccessCatalog.
SystemRequirement019 status inherited.
SystemRequirement019 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-019: Authoritative revalidation".
SystemRequirement019 specifies "Frontend/BuckingWeb may pre-check capabilities for UX, but the owning service SHALL validate every command authoritatively on receipt.".
SystemRequirement019 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement019 constrains ValidateMachineCommand.
SystemRequirement020 status inherited.
SystemRequirement020 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-020: Semantic operator injection".
SystemRequirement020 specifies "MachineService SHALL support an explicit semantic operator-input command path so trusted clients can trigger normalized operator events without fabricating P1000 wire frames.".
SystemRequirement020 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement020 constrains InjectSemanticOperatorInput.
SystemRequirement021 status inherited.
SystemRequirement021 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-021: Simulator wire injection remains separate".
SystemRequirement021 specifies "P1000Simulator SHALL provide a separate control path (`simctl`/SimulatorUI) that produces wire-faithful P1000 behavior for end-to-end parser testing.".
SystemRequirement021 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement021 constrains HandleSimulatorControl.
SystemRequirement022 status inherited.
SystemRequirement022 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-022: Bounded subscriber behavior".
SystemRequirement022 specifies "No subscriber SHALL be able to cause unbounded memory growth or indefinitely block an authoritative service due to slow consumption.".
SystemRequirement022 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement022 constrains BoundedSubscribers.
SystemRequirement023 status inherited.
SystemRequirement023 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-023: Delivery class".
SystemRequirement023 specifies "Every published event family SHALL have an explicit delivery/backpressure class: non-supersedable, supersedable/latest-wins, or diagnostic/bounded-with-gap-reporting.".
SystemRequirement023 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement023 constrains ScheduleSubscriberDelivery.
SystemRequirement024 status inherited.
SystemRequirement024 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-024: Durable facts not dropped".
SystemRequirement024 specifies "Cut/production facts, command results and accepted configuration activation events SHALL NOT use latest-wins replacement semantics.".
SystemRequirement024 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement024 constrains DurableFactsRetained.
SystemRequirement025 status inherited.
SystemRequirement025 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-025: Reconnect detection".
SystemRequirement025 specifies "Clients SHALL detect service-session changes and **delivery-stream** gaps and SHALL resynchronize according to typed subscription/resume outcomes rather than treating sparse source-event sequence as loss.".
SystemRequirement025 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement025 constrains RecoverUiSession.
SystemRequirement026 status inherited.
SystemRequirement026 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-026: Graceful shutdown".
SystemRequirement026 specifies "Runtime constituents SHALL define deterministic shutdown behavior for sockets, workers, event queues and persisted Lab/production state.".
SystemRequirement026 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement026 constrains ShutdownServiceRuntime.
SystemRequirement027 status inherited.
SystemRequirement027 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-027: MachineService authority".
SystemRequirement027 specifies "MachineService SHALL own P1000 semantic decoding, protocol state machines, calibrated machine state and evidence-backed P1000 ACK decisions.".
SystemRequirement027 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement027 constrains AdvanceP1000Protocol.
SystemRequirement028 status inherited.
SystemRequirement028 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-028: Gateway semantic neutrality".
SystemRequirement028 specifies "p1000-gateway SHALL NOT invent P1000 semantic responses or autonomous P1000 ACK policy.".
SystemRequirement028 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement028 constrains P1000Gateway.
SystemRequirement029 status inherited.
SystemRequirement029 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-029: P1000 framing evidence".
SystemRequirement029 specifies "P1000 frame parsing SHALL remain length-driven and capture-backed; payload occurrences of `FF` SHALL NOT be treated as unconditional frame boundaries.".
SystemRequirement029 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement029 constrains DecodeP1000Frames.
SystemRequirement030 status inherited.
SystemRequirement030 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-030: Explicit protocol state machines".
SystemRequirement030 specifies "P1000 boot/runtime/control behavior SHALL be implemented as explicit testable state machines rather than distributed implicit callback flags.".
SystemRequirement030 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement030 constrains AdvanceP1000Protocol.
SystemRequirement031 status inherited.
SystemRequirement031 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-031: Calibration ownership".
SystemRequirement031 specifies "MachineService SHALL own active calibration revision/state and SHALL expose calibrated engineering values when available while preserving explicit unavailable/unknown state, raw provenance and evidence traceability.".
SystemRequirement031 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement031 constrains CalibrateMeasurement.
SystemRequirement032 status inherited.
SystemRequirement032 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-032: Absolute and working coordinates".
SystemRequirement032 specifies "The machine/bucking contracts SHALL distinguish absolute stem coordinates from working-root-relative coordinates where both are required.".
SystemRequirement032 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement032 constrains MaintainAbsoluteProfile.
SystemRequirement033 status inherited.
SystemRequirement033 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-033: Bounded inbound target buffer".
SystemRequirement033 specifies "The physical gateway SHALL support explicit bounded RX buffering across MachineService disconnects/restarts and SHALL report overflow/gaps.".
SystemRequirement033 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement033 constrains BufferTargetHistory.
SystemRequirement034 status inherited.
SystemRequirement034 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-034: Explicit resume policy".
