SystemRequirement088 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-088: GlobalStop occurrence lifecycle".
SystemRequirement088 specifies "`stop_id` SHALL identify one stop occurrence. MachineService dedupe/conflict state SHALL be scoped to its current service session and advertised retention horizon: same-ID/same-payload is idempotent while retained, same-ID/different-payload conflicts while retained, a new MachineService service session may safely process the ID again, and post-retention reuse in the same session is processed as a new occurrence so an expired record cannot suppress a later genuine stop.".
SystemRequirement088 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement088 constrains StopState.
SystemRequirement089 status inherited.
SystemRequirement089 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-089: Connection-bound peer identity".
SystemRequirement089 specifies "Authoritative provenance and authority decisions SHALL be bound to server connection/peer context rather than trusted from caller-supplied command metadata. Wave-1 internal control services SHALL bind loopback/trusted-host by default; externally reachable control requires an explicit authenticated access design.".
SystemRequirement089 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement089 constrains ServerBoundAuthority.
SystemRequirement090 status inherited.
SystemRequirement090 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-090: Command retry and result recovery".
SystemRequirement090 specifies "For the lifetime advertised by the owning service, repeating the same `command_id` with the same semantic payload SHALL NOT execute the action again and SHALL return/recover the known lifecycle result. Reusing the same `command_id` with a different payload SHALL be rejected as a conflict. Expired/unknown command IDs SHALL never be silently executed as retries.".
SystemRequirement090 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement090 constrains RecoverCommandLifecycle.
SystemRequirement091 status inherited.
SystemRequirement091 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-091: Source sequence versus delivery sequence".
SystemRequirement091 specifies "Source `event_seq` SHALL remain global/immutable within a service session. Each active subscription delivery stream SHALL expose a separate contiguous delivery sequence used for gap detection; filtering and supersession SHALL NOT be interpreted as source-event loss.".
SystemRequirement091 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement091 constrains DistinctSequenceDomains.
SystemRequirement092 status inherited.
SystemRequirement092 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-092: Typed resume and complete baseline".
SystemRequirement092 specifies "Subscription establishment/resume SHALL return a typed outcome such as live-started, resumed, snapshot-required or outside-retention. A snapshot or explicit per-family recovery query SHALL provide enough authoritative baseline state to continue safely after snapshot-required/outside-retention outcomes.".
SystemRequirement092 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement092 constrains CommitUiBaseline.
SystemRequirement093 status inherited.
SystemRequirement093 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-093: Hello and subscription lifecycle".
SystemRequirement093 specifies "Service contracts SHALL define Hello ordering/negotiation failure, handshake timeout, selected contract version, exactly one active subscription per connection, second-Subscribe replacement semantics and explicit Unsubscribe behavior.".
SystemRequirement093 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement093 constrains NegotiateServiceSession.
SystemRequirement094 status inherited.
SystemRequirement094 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-094: Evidence and unavailable measurement state".
SystemRequirement094 specifies "Evidence-derived semantic values SHALL represent confidence/evidence reference where required, and unavailable/uncalibrated engineering values SHALL remain distinguishable from legitimate numeric zero.".
SystemRequirement094 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
SystemRequirement094 constrains ConservativeQuality.
