SystemRequirement095 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-095: Lab request/session/replay safety".
SystemRequirement095 specifies "Lab v1 SHALL provide request correlation, source-session-qualified cursors, observable Lab record sequence, explicit admin capabilities, bounded/streamable export/import behavior and server-configured replay targets rather than arbitrary caller-provided live endpoints.".
