SystemRequirement096 describes "MVP1-SYS-REQ-096: Monorepo workspace authority".
SystemRequirement096 specifies "MVP1 SHALL freeze one Go workspace/module topology and one npm workspace/lockfile topology, including generated-binding consumption paths and ownership, before parallel workers modify constituent build metadata.".
SystemRequirement096 cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
