SystemRequirement098 specifies "Garden-critical contracts SHALL have provider/consumer behavioral fixtures for handshake, filtered delivery, latest-wins/coalescing, resume/snapshot/outside-retention, slow-consumer behavior, duplicate commands/result recovery, authority binding and GlobalStop deduplication in addition to byte codec fixtures.".
